      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-01",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "世界上的教育都讓我失望。"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:21",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-01",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "选择什么是“对”或“错”是一项艰难的任务，我们却必须要完成它。"
    },
    {
      "author": "fucongcong",
      "language": "zh",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
